      "instrument_id": "EQ09",
      "role": "supplementary",
      "technique": "High-content epifluorescence imaging",
      "why": "While designed for fluorescence, Keyence systems typically feature advanced 'all-in-focus' (Z-stacking) and stitching capabilities that are excellent for documenting defects across curved 3D surfaces.",
      "accessories_to_confirm": [
